  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.0-0.ancient": "[sine]..盟军...指挥官...你的...科技...或许...会...燃烧...但...你的...意志...永存...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.0-0.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.0-1.char": "盟军永不退缩。我们将克服前进道路上的一切障碍。",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.0-2.ancient": "[sine]..很好...你的...信念...将在...塔中...经受...考验...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.1-0.ancient": "[sine]..你...回来了...仍然...屹立不倒...你的...军队...已经...学会了...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.1-0.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.1-1.char": "每一场战斗都教会我们。每一次失败都让我们更加强大。我们是盟军。",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.1-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.1-2.ancient": "[sine]..去吧...你的...战术...赢得了...又一次...机会...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.2-0.ancient": "[sine]..第三次了...你的...韧性...令人...印象深刻...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.2-0.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.2-1.char": "韧性？这只是我们的标准操作程序。",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.2-2.ancient": "[sine]..完美...塔...将记住...你的...名字...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.0-0.ancient": "[sine]..苏联...指挥官...你的...火力...令人...印象深刻...但...你能...经受住...塔的...考验吗...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.0-0.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.0-1.char": "苏联不问能否承受——它要求胜利！",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.0-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.0-2.ancient": "[sine]..热情...是...火焰...让我们...看看...它能否...燃烧得...明亮...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.1-0.ancient": "[sine]..你...回来了...仍然...怒火中烧...你的...钢铁洪流...势不可挡...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.1-0.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.1-1.char": "苏联军队永不撤退。每一场战斗都让我们更接近胜利。",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.1-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.1-2.ancient": "[sine]..去吧...你的...火焰...尚未...熄灭...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.2-0.ancient": "[sine]..第三次了...你的...决心...坚不可摧...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.2-0.next": "回应",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.2-1.char": "坚不可摧？这就是苏联的精神！",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.2-1.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.2-2.ancient": "[sine]..很好...你的...传奇...将在...塔中...回响...[/sine]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.0-0r.ancient": "[red]盟军[/red]。你的科技令人印象深刻，但它无法拯救你于不可避免的崩溃之中。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.0-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.0-1r.char": "不可避免？盟军总能找到出路。我们的智慧无穷无尽！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.0-2r.ancient": "没有目的的智慧只是噪音。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.0-3r.char": "我们的目标很明确：为世界带来秩序与自由！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.1-0r.ancient": "[red]盟军[/red]，你像孩子抓玩具一样抓着你的科技不放。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.1-1r.char": "科技是我们的工具，不是我们的拐杖。而且我们知道如何使用它。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.1-2r.ancient": "那就证明给我看。让我看看你的'工具'能做什么。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.1-3r.char": "我们的智慧无穷无尽！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.2-0r.ancient": "[red]盟军[/red]，你的坚持...出人意料。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.2-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.2-1r.char": "出人意料？这就是盟军的作风。我们适应，我们克服，我们胜利。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.2-2r.ancient": "我们看看你的胜利是否能延伸到塔顶。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.2-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.2-3r.char": "我们看看谁的战术更胜一筹。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.3-0r.ancient": "[red]盟军[/red]，你已经走得很远了...但最后一步才是最关键的。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.3-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.3-1r.char": "我们已经做好了准备。无论前方是什么，盟军都不会退缩。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.3-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.3-2r.ancient": "那么，让我看看你的决心是否足以赢得最终的胜利。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.3-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.3-3r.char": "为了胜利，我们愿意付出一切。盟军的荣耀永不熄灭！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.4-0r.ancient": "[red]盟军[/red]...你到达了这里...令人印象深刻。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.4-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.4-1r.char": "我们不仅是到达这里——我们是一路战斗过来的。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.4-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.4-2r.ancient": "那么，证明你的价值。让我看看你是否配得上塔顶的荣耀。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.4-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.4-3r.char": "我们配得上！盟军将证明我们的智慧、我们的勇气、我们的决心！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.5-0r.ancient": "[red]盟军[/red]...又一次...你让我感到意外。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.5-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.5-1r.char": "意外？我们只是按照盟军的方式前进——适应、克服、胜利。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.5-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.5-2r.ancient": "塔顶的荣耀近在咫尺。证明你配得上它。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.5-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.5-3r.char": "我们不仅配得上，我们就是荣耀本身！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.6-0r.ancient": "[red]盟军[/red]...你达到了新的高度...让我看看你是否有资格站在塔顶。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.6-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.6-1r.char": "资格？我们用智慧、勇气和决心赢得了站在这里的权利！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.6-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.6-2r.ancient": "那么，最终的考验来了。证明你不是浪得虚名。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.6-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_ALLIES.6-3r.char": "浪得虚名？让我们看看谁才是真正的传奇！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.0-0r.ancient": "[red]苏联[/red]。你的蛮力将在塔的防御面前粉碎。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.0-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.0-1r.char": "蛮力？这是苏联人民的力量！我们将粉碎所有反对我们的人！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.0-2r.ancient": "傲慢不是力量。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.0-3r.char": "那就让我们看看谁才是真正强大的！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.1-0r.ancient": "[red]苏联[/red]，你的火力令人印象深刻，但缺乏精准。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.1-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.1-1r.char": "精准？我们有更好的东西——压倒性的力量！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.1-2r.ancient": "没有方向的力量就是混乱。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.1-3r.char": "没有方向的力量就是混乱...但红军会找到方向！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.2-0r.ancient": "[red]苏联[/red]，你的决心...以自己的方式...令人钦佩。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.2-0r.next": "回应",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.2-1r.char": "令人钦佩？我们不寻求钦佩。我们寻求胜利！",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.RED_ALERT2_MOD_CHARACTER_SOVIET.2-1r.next": "继续",
